              "text": "la baraja — \"the pack of cards\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Saca la baraja y jugamos. Get the cards out and let us play."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Barajar — to shuffle. La baraja española has 40 or 48 cards."
            }
          ]
        },
