          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "baraja is built on barajar (EtymDB), which in Old Spanish meant to quarrel, then to mix up and shuffle. Beyond that the origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
